      "text": "This disease and damage from it can't be healed until the curse is removed.\n\nA creature killed by this curse turns to sand and can't be resurrected except by a 9th-rank Resurrect ritual or similar magic\n\n---\n\nSaving Throw DC 39 Fortitude save\n\nStage 1 carrier with no ill effect (1 minute)\n\nStage 2 15d6 void damage and Stupefied 2 (1 day)"
